---
import Layout from "@layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="How Enquire is built"
  description="How I put Enquire together: WhatsApp tips, privacy redaction, a bit of LLM help, and me checking the result before it goes live."
>
  <div class="about-container">
    <header class="about-header">
      <h1>About Enquire</h1>
      <p class="subtitle">
        An unofficial relocation guide for CERN newcomers. Not affiliated with CERN.
      </p>
    </header>

    <section class="about-section" aria-labelledby="how-heading">
      <h2 id="how-heading">How this is built</h2>
      <p>
        Most of the useful stuff starts in WhatsApp groups. Someone asks where to get a haircut
        or how to open a bank account, gets a few good replies, and then it all scrolls away. I
        built Enquire so that advice doesn't disappear.
      </p>
      <ol class="pipeline">
        <li>
          <strong>Extract.</strong> I pull the relevant bits out of chat exports.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Redact.</strong> Names, private numbers, and other personal data come out before
          anything else happens.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Draft.</strong> An LLM helps turn the redacted notes into listings and guides,
          and pokes holes in anything that looks sketchy or outdated.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Review.</strong> I read through it before it goes live, but I haven't personally
          checked every shop or admin rule myself.
        </li>
      </ol>
    </section>

    <section class="about-section" aria-labelledby="caveat-heading">
      <h2 id="caveat-heading">A few caveats</h2>
      <p>
        This is not official advice. Rules change, shops close, and border admin is a mess. Use
        these pages as a head start, then double-check with CERN HR, your landlord, an insurer, or
        the place itself when it actually matters.
      </p>
      <p>
        Something wrong or outdated? Drop a comment on the page, use
        <a href="/suggest">Suggest</a>, or open a PR on
        <a href="https://github.com/riky-dev/enquire" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
          >GitHub</a
        >.
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .about-container {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2.5rem;
  }

  .about-header {
    text-align: left;
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: 3rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    letter-spacing: 0;
  }

  .subtitle {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .about-section h2 {
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
  }

  .about-section p {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
  }

  .about-section p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .about-section a {
    color: var(--accent-primary);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .about-section a:hover {
    color: var(--accent-hover);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 0.18em;
  }

  .pipeline {
    margin: 0;
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .pipeline strong {
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .pipeline a {
    color: var(--accent-primary);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .pipeline a:hover {
    color: var(--accent-hover);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 0.18em;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    h1 {
      font-size: 2.25rem;
    }
  }
</style>
